Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.24,0:00:03.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.75,0:00:05.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:09.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不願意看到變成這樣所以在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員棄艦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:23.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複　全員棄艦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Takemikazuchi  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.65,0:00:32.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐　請退下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:36.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然自覺已經死過一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.09,0:00:38.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就帶著志同道合的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:40.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到Archangel去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:43.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣總有一天會找到道路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,特達嘎上校
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:37.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,主引擎沒有嚴重的損傷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.76,0:02:42.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是武器和船體都損壞得非常厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.18,0:02:45.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣子實在不可能修復啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:47.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說是Freedom幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:52.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,唉　就算是FAITH也贏不了那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.81,0:02:56.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS中Saviour Warrior重度破損
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:57.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Phantom中度破損
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,形勢很嚴峻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還差一點就要到直布羅陀了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:06.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又得待在這裡等待修理和補給是很難受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:09.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:13.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,次次都是讓人覺得心情鬱悶的戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.45,0:03:16.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又不算是戰敗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:19.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對空對潛　嚴密警戒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後拜託你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:22.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:28.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,"到目前為止的責任由我承擔"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:34.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,"既然自覺已經死過一次　就到Archangel去"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,"也為了今天枉死在這裡的將士"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:42.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是特達嘎上校的遺言
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,屢次違背您的命令而作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:52.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,犧牲了戰艦和無數將士的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:55.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在此誠心請罪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此懇求您
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.28,0:04:02.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,理解特達嘎上校和我等的苦衷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您能夠明白
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:08.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後我等也將與Archangel同進退
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:09.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:12.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基上尉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.89,0:04:16.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…我才對不起你們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.37,0:04:20.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我太愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,太軟弱
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:29.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓奧布寶貴的有志之士們…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:30.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.40,0:04:34.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.91,0:04:35.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:36.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:37.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:48.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.43,0:04:50.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別哭　卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們所知的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.59,0:05:01.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是不能再這樣下去而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:07.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…該做些什麼都還不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許攻擊ZAFT也不對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊地球軍也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.33,0:05:17.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事也已經做過不少了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以憎恨無法停止
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:26.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭無法結束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.25,0:05:31.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,或許因為我們也在不停地戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:34.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才無法做到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.89,0:05:37.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們大家也許都是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT和地球軍一定也是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.38,0:05:44.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想要一個能幸福生活的世界而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:47.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:50.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果各位也都這麼想…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然　基拉先生
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:06:00.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們並非抱著復仇或是想戰鬥的心情來此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:05.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是一群因為信奉奧布的理念
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:08.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才投身戰場的奧布軍人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:13.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…希望能為那個真正的奧布而戰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:17.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們深知這十分艱難
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.39,0:06:20.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此　我們才要和卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和這艘船同進退
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.43,0:06:24.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:28.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白了　很抱歉說了失禮的話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:30.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請多多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:32.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　彼此彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:00.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:01.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.37,0:07:03.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.56,0:07:08.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:17.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:24.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你給的　還記得吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.93,0:07:28.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡…好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:43.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護我…真
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:49.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.11,0:07:52.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:13.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  結果又是真把敵艦都解決掉的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是敵艦隊　幾乎全滅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真最近好像很厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva　Sword Silhouette 什麼的　
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:23.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,叫得可神氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.72,0:08:28.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,簡直是完美王牌的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.29,0:08:30.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然他總是脾氣暴躁很可怕的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:33.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥中好像更誇張似的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.09,0:08:34.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:38.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐　沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧？ 虧妳還好意思問
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.78,0:08:44.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人家都受傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:45.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不來探望一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:49.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為人家一直在值班嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:51.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的　算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿斯蘭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:55.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他怎樣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:56.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:01.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Saviour竟然被毀成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:09.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他沒受傷哦　完全沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過不知道現在在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.41,0:09:16.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:19.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事　雖然完全被打爛了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:21.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個 阿斯蘭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.23,0:09:25.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他怎樣了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?　不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被Freedom華麗地砍了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是在房間裡消沉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個人也沒多強嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何那樣還能當上FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.79,0:09:51.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就因為以前很強?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:11.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  目的必須完成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:14.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切命令都只為需要而下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:17.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是在玩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.69,0:10:21.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就是為此而存在的 別忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.91,0:10:23.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了什麼而戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:25.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:30.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一旦開始思考這種事就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:31.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.18,0:10:37.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎　還是無能為力?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:40.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是　已經是時間問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:47.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能活著送回去　也不需要這麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:48.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:52.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再繼續使用生命維持裝置反而有副作用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.64,0:10:57.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使解剖　也難以得到正確的數據了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:11:01.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種樣本研究所裡已經取得很多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:07.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,評議會想要的還是活著的強化人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.01,0:11:11.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,裝置還是照舊使用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:15.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能的話　還是希望活著送回去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.83,0:11:17.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是　明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我盡力而為
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:21.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.07,0:11:25.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對了　真呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:27.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有來看她嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是　時常過來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:34.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不知道為何這麼在意她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.58,0:11:36.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:55.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:59.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要自然人全死光戰爭就會結束
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:02.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是這場戰爭的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.07,0:12:04.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣發展下去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:05.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,世界將成為…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,兩個互不認同的人種無止盡地爭鬥下去的戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:15.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的話真希望我也能做點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:21.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這才是比什麼都難的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  卡嘉莉現在在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:35.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你要說這場戰鬥　這些犧牲都是迫不得已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:38.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是奧布和卡嘉莉的錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.84,0:12:40.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你就能攻擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對著卡嘉莉正要保護的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:50.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:52.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.28,0:12:55.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.23,0:13:01.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不待在寢室　倒在這裡消沉起來了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.20,0:13:03.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真悠閒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.52,0:13:07.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜在擔心　打聽你怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:10.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自己明明也受了傷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:11.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:14.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續一副自以為了不起的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:16.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹不出什麼事來也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.92,0:13:18.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.45,0:13:20.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,錯都在地球軍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:24.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不也是為了和他們戰鬥才回ZAFT的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.04,0:13:29.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就應該要振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:47.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:50.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.17,0:13:53.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼晚了什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.70,0:14:17.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:21.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:25.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.56,0:14:32.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我會遵守約定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:39.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,保護史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.89,0:14:53.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過到了直布羅陀倒還有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:58.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡是放了假也回不了家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂　在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在那裡幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:07.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.35,0:15:12.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:25.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:27.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.81,0:15:31.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後會像試驗用動物一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:37.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不願意看到變成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.54,0:15:44.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你會回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:47.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快　我幫你打開閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:56.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼生命只要有機會都會想要活下去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:10.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:13.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係　稍微忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:23.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 發生什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:26.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,醫療室報告說強化人失蹤了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:34.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開門　可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:38.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了　真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:39.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.69,0:17:00.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長　Impulse它…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,地球軍的位置　Gaia的信號
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.22,0:17:23.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好　這樣一來…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:28.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是雷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:35.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對　沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.10,0:17:38.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在沒有能追擊的機體
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:42.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉　阿斯蘭可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:43.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請離開
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:47.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:48.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:58.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.64,0:18:02.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用什麼追擊　真也會回來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:04.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事　雷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:07.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是那個人的指示嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:10.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gaia的識別信號…這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:13.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚　但一直在用它在呼叫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:17.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員第二戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.48,0:18:21.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此　能出擊的也只剩我的Windam了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:24.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧　回答看看
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:25.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.03,0:18:33.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通知尼歐　史黛拉在等他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到地點S228　一個人過來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:40.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複　通知尼歐　史黛拉在等他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到地點S228　一個人過來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:44.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.25,0:18:48.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的事是我自己犯下的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.41,0:18:51.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請給於相應的處分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真　只是去歸還她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.22,0:18:57.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會回來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:00.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.83,0:19:04.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要一個人去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.11,0:19:08.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Chaos既然還不能用　也沒其他辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是陷阱　也要去試了才知道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.91,0:19:12.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:14.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就交給你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.79,0:19:22.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再等等　史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:24.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:27.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐一定會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.88,0:19:40.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.39,0:19:55.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我到了　我是尼歐 羅阿諾克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:57.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按約定一個人來了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:12.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不想讓她死掉才來送還的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:15.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以絕對要向我保證
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.55,0:20:19.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕不讓她再靠近戰爭和MS…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:22.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種與死亡相關的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:26.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,送她回到平和溫暖的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我向你保證
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:52.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.62,0:20:57.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是否該說感謝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:20:59.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這都無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:01.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是　剛才說的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.76,0:21:02.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:06.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:07.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.94,0:21:16.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉她喜歡這個　所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:19.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記　史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.31,0:21:25.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘記我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:05.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.11,0:23:26.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只能相信　只能托付於他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:29.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為不想看見不同的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.90,0:23:33.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,踐踏一片熱心的是他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.67,0:23:34.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還是另有他人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.95,0:23:37.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,知道黑暗的盡頭時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:40.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這雙瞳孔中倒映的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.48,0:23:44.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集　機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:46.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不明之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:49.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突破艱難的險阻　Destroy
